            "review_title": "Review at Healthy Meal Box",
            "review_text": "Barry M\nDa Nang, Vietnam436 contributions\n0\nNot hippy food\nMay 2019 • Solo\nLet’s be clear here, I don’t do hippy food. Non of that vegan lentil tofu stuff for me. But that’s not what this place is about. Beef steak, ribs, salmon and chicken are all on the menu, but they don’t come with french fries. OK they have that veggie seaweed stuff too if you really must punish yourself. \n\nFantastic service, wonderfully friendly, happy and helpful. Don’t tell them this, ridiculously cheap considering the quality. Probably the cleanest restaurant in Vietnam too. \n\nAnd why didn’t one of you tell me healthy food could taste this good?\nRead more\nWritten May 24, 2019",
