            "review_text": "chelsxe\n3 contributions\n0\nsurprisingly too good!!\nMay 2019 • Friends\nchanced upon this restaurant and at first i was skeptical but after looking up on the net for some reviews, it seemed the food here was good so we decided to give it a try. \n\n+ healthy food\n+ reasonable price\n+ clean!!! like super clean i love clean restaurants\n+ aesthetically pleasing! \n\ni also love how the staff here were really friendly and the service was really good! \n\ni ordered a grilled salmon and it was so good! \ni ordered a chicken soup too but was however disappointed with it... it was too diluted? i know its a healthy concept but the soup really had no taste to it\n\nif the chicken soup was better i would definitely have given 5 stars! \n\ni would definitely come back again!\nRead more\nWritten May 17, 2019",
